Rem AMCAF Bank Stretch to 100 (a test of its own: the original leaves its memory so that the machine fails at the end of a program that stretches several banks)
Reserve As Work 5,100
S=Start(5)
For I=0 To 99 : Poke S+I,(I*7+3) mod 256 : Next I
Bank Name 5,"Test"
Bank Stretch 5 To 100
S=Start(5)
Print #1,"len";Length(5);Bank Name$(5)
For I=0 To Length(5)-1 : Print #1,Peek(S+I);" ";: Next I
Print #1,""
Goto FIN
FIN:
